BT 1 0 0 1 0 57.7 Tm 11 TL /F1 8.3 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The Recruitment & Placement Management System \(RPMS\) is a Python application that helps a college manage student placement) Tj T* (activities. It stores details of students, companies, job openings and applications in a MySQL database. It checks whether a student) Tj T* (meets the eligibility conditions before applying for a job. It also manages interviews, selection, job offers and final placements. The) Tj T* (system follows a proper recruitment process so that important stages are completed in order. It provides reports about candidates, job) Tj T* (openings, application status and placed students. This system reduces manual work and keeps placement information organised in one) Tj T* (place.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 476.8583 cm
q
.117647 .352941 .568627 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 2.5 Tm /F3 9.5 Tf 12 TL (2. What business problem does this project solve?) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 437.8583 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 24.7 Tm /F1 8.3 Tf 11 TL (Managing placements manually can lead to duplicate records, incorrect eligibility checks, missed deadlines and difficulty tracking) Tj T* (student progress. RPMS keeps placement information in one database and applies the same rules to every application. It helps) Tj T* (placement staff manage candidates, companies, jobs, interviews and offers more accurately and saves time.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
 

